<title>USA: Republic Industries names senior vice pres.</title>
<headline>Republic Industries names senior vice pres.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Industries Inc said on Wednesday it named H. Scott Barrett senior vice president of information technology.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Republic, Barret served as president of domestic retail at the Blockbuster Entertainment Group of Viacom Inc, the company said.</p>
<p>Republic Industries is a holding company with subsidiaries in automotive retailing, rental and financial services, solid waste services and electronic security services.</p>
